    "body": "ZORR MODE\n\nTYPE = DUNCAN SANDBOX / DRAWING QC EXPERIMENT\nSTATUS = DRAW_QC_R01_PASS\nPRODUCTION_MUTATION = NO\nCANON_MUTATION = NO\nMERGE_AUTHORIZED = NO\n\n## EXACT BASE / HEAD\nBASE_MAIN_OBSERVED = b18ca6b9cce2dce6fe304ca8ae36c05df4f4dcb1\nHEAD = 2fa26a3d160184cf4a222c7c3c215ba39c9a7a7a\nBRANCH = duncan3/zorr-draw-qc-r01\n\nAuthority: #199 character drawing law; #201 visual taboo; #206 hard open-code law.\n\n## OPEN CODE REUSED\nOpenCV upstream branch 4.x exact observed SHA:\n755546643a671420fae0c20ec5d4cd24a228da8e\nLicense = Apache-2.0.\nInspected upstream implementation/tests before ZORR glue:\n- modules/core/src/kmeans.cpp\n- modules/imgproc/src/canny.cpp\n- modules/python/test/test_kmeans.py\nCI runtime pins:\n- numpy==2.3.5\n- opencv-python-headless==4.14.0.94\n\n## IMPLEMENTED MEASURABLE R01 ENVELOPE\nAt normalized head width 397 px:\n- tone bands = 4..6\n- strong-edge Sobel density = 0.08..0.14\n- deep ink coverage = <0.05\n- line hierarchy ratio p95(distance-transform radius)/median >= 4.0\n- high-frequency Laplacian variance <= 800\n\nThese are sandbox R01 QC thresholds derived from the approved anchor + #199, not a new canon lock.\n\n## TDD EVIDENCE\nRED_HEAD = d8d2f1193457eb1c3de157fc93317195a7750477\nRED_RUN = 33295705838\nRED_RESULT = FAILURE\nPinned dependency install = SUCCESS; DRAW_QC_R01 test step = FAILURE while implementation path was absent (404).\n\nGREEN_HEAD = 2fa26a3d160184cf4a222c7c3c215ba39c9a7a7a\nGREEN_RUN = 33295781359\nGREEN_RESULT = SUCCESS\nDRAW_QC_R01 tests = SUCCESS.\nExisting hq-validate and oss-security on GREEN_HEAD = SUCCESS.\n\n## PRIVATE PHYSICAL TRANSFER CHECK\nApproved anchor SHA256:\n4e49ef4f3a6ee15f81a542371f2b2ec6ef03f1d41a07c0d8d132d3bbc55c3f6f\nNo private anchor bytes committed.\nThree isolated approved heads:\n1) tones=5 edge=0.102438 ink=0.026549 line_ratio=6.0 highfreq=436.516 => PASS\n2) tones=4 edge=0.107465 ink=0.027389 line_ratio=6.0 highfreq=524.368 => PASS\n3) tones=5 edge=0.106705 ink=0.027619 line_ratio=6.0 highfreq=536.259 => PASS\nANCHOR_SELF_TEST = 3/3 PASS\n\nKnown rejected generated sample A SHA256:\n24936f33e6dd77e40cbcc98ba87bdf830eb7daa7f4b7b82736d2744890867fab\nmetrics: tones=6 edge=0.157684 ink=0.019834 line_ratio=1.4 highfreq=1468.779\n=> FAIL [STYLE_EDGE_DENSITY_FAIL, STYLE_LINE_HIERARCHY_FAIL, STYLE_TOO_NOISY]\n\nKnown rejected generated sample B SHA256:\n03012ba8df9c816fef41c9a69a5e736721760ed0ac14ae23ba1775dffa8ce588\nmetrics: tones=7 edge=0.128353 ink=0.006223 line_ratio=2.0 highfreq=1288.650\n=> FAIL [STYLE_TONE_COUNT_FAIL, STYLE_LINE_HIERARCHY_FAIL, STYLE_TOO_NOISY]\n\nNEGATIVE_DISCRIMINATION = 2/2 FAIL_AS_EXPECTED\n\n## R01 VERDICT\nANCHOR_SELF_TEST = PASS\nNEGATIVE_DISCRIMINATION = PASS\nDEDICATED_CI = PASS\nPRODUCTION/CANON MUTATION = NO\nDRAW_QC_R01 = PASS\n\nNo claim is made that SALVADOR model weights are trained or production-promoted by this sandbox PR.",
